  "sourceTitle": "Marinade For Beef Roast",
  "sourceText": "Marinade For Beef Roast\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:31pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 (6-7 lb.) sirloin tip roast, cut in slices\n1 1/2 cups salad oil\n1/4 cup Worcestershire sauce\n cup lemon juice\n3/4 cup soy sauce\n1/2 cup wine vinegar\n1/2 cup parsley flakes\n2 teaspoons pepper\n2 1/4 teaspoons salt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix and put over roast. Let marinate overnight. Grill and enjoy.",
